; claude: what every application shares, whatever it is a document of
; (see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md, phase 6): a
; document as a value (Document), the versions of it you can go back
; to (Undo), and what was cut or copied (Clipboard). appkits/ sits
; beside kits/ and the name says the relation: kits/ is what games of
; a genre share, appkits/ is what applications share.
;
; Independent of everything -- no gui, no playground, no shapes: a
; document is a value, and these are the rules about values. A private
; library, installed as part of elm_playground: pure OCaml, so every
; backend, the web one included, can use it.
(library
 (name appkit_document)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
